bs demo: GitHub MCP issue text steers the agent to leak private repo data (2025-05-26)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#x27;font-size:9px&#x27;&gt;https://invariantlabs.ai/blog/mcp-github-vulnerability&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign=&#x27;top&#x27; style=&#x27;padding:4px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E7EC; background:#F9FAFB;&#x27;&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;display:inline-block;margin:1px;padding:0 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:10px;font-weight:bold;line-height:15px;background:#C9302C;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #C9302C;&#x27;&gt;S8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign=&#x27;top&#x27; style=&#x27;padding:4px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E7EC; background:#F9FAFB;&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;P4&lt;/b&gt; Gateway (API Management or AI Gateway)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign=&#x27;top&#x27; style=&#x27;padding:4px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E7EC; background:#F9FAFB;&#x27;&gt;Spoofing&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign=&#x27;top&#x27; style=&#x27;padding:4px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E7EC; background:#F9FAFB;&#x27;&gt;The gateway lets a caller pass on its source address alone, without a valid token.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign=&#x27;top&#x27; style=&#x27;padding:4px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E7EC; background:#F9FAFB;&#x27;&gt;ctrl-identity ctrl-m365-network&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign=&#x27;top&#x27; style=&#x27;padding:4px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E7EC; background:#F9FAFB;&#x27;&gt;8&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign=&#x27;top&#x27; style=&#x27;padding:4px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E7EC; background:#F9FAFB;&#x27;&gt;7&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign=&#x27;top&#x27; style=&#x27;padding:4px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E7EC; background:#F9FAFB;&#x27;&gt;7&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign=&#x27;top&#x27; style=&#x27;padding:4px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E7EC; background:#F9FAFB;&#x27;&gt;6&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign=&#x27;top&#x27; style=&#x27;padding:4px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E7EC; background:#F9FAFB;&#x27;&gt;7&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign=&#x27;top&#x27; style=&#x27;paddin